The function then lists all existing projects in the directory tree by reading the contents of the `PROJECTS_DIR` directory using the `fs::read_dir()` method and filtering out any non-directory entries. The names and versions of each project are extracted from the file name and version number, respectively, using the `PathBuf::file_name()` and `PathBuf::extension()` methods.

