To handle task dependencies, you can define a `dependency_t` structure to hold information about a dependency between two tasks, such as the source and destination tasks and the type of dependency (e.g., start-to-start or finish-to-start). You can then create an array of `dependency_t` structures to manage multiple dependencies.
