The functions `createJobPosting()` and `createNode()` dynamically allocate memory for a job posting and a linked list node, respectively. The function `addJobPosting()` adds a job posting to the linked list by creating a new node for it and adding it to the head of the list. The function `removeJobPosting()` removes a job posting from the linked list by finding the corresponding node and removing it from the list.

